## Reporting Queries

### Example Analytics Queries
```sql
-- Most difficult questions
SELECT 
    q.id,
    q.question,
    qa.times_shown,
    qa.correct_answers,
    (qa.correct_answers / qa.times_answered * 100) as success_rate
FROM questions q
JOIN question_analytics qa ON q.id = qa.question_id
WHERE qa.times_answered > 10
ORDER BY success_rate ASC
LIMIT 10;

-- User engagement over time
SELECT 
    DATE(created_at) as date,
    COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) as active_users,
    COUNT(*) as total_events
FROM events
WHERE created_at >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 30 DAY)
GROUP BY DATE(created_at)
ORDER BY date DESC;
```

